{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo for <strong>Legends of Azamar</strong> is a fast-paced action RPG focused on loot, dungeon crawling, and visceral combat. Answer the call of <strong>Tag Lodahn</strong>, a dwarven mining town now overwhelmed by relentless incursions. Driven by glory, treasure, or duty, descend into the depths, battle deadly foes, and uncover the secrets that lie below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes (Demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms as the <strong>Warrior</strong>, mastering unique weapons, abilities, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(More classes will be available in the full release.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawling Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends of Azamar</strong> is an ARPG condensed to its core.\u00a0Descend, fight, loot, return to camp, and repeat. Face increasingly deadly challenges as you push deeper, growing stronger with each expedition, culminating in brutal boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face Tag Lodahn's ever-shifting depths? Each expedition will never be the same with procedurally generated dungeons, dynamic paths, quests, and unique items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  character with legendary equipment, powerful passives, and devastating abilities. Shape your path with six unique passive skill trees, each offering new avenues of character customisation. Will you become an unbreakable juggernaut by following the path of the <strong>Tower</strong>? Or embrace the <strong>Serpent</strong>\u2019s cunning, and strike with lethal poisons? Or will you walk your own path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Content</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>Warrior</strong> class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>entirety of Act 1</strong>, delving into the mines beneath Tag Lodahn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play until the level cap of\u00a0<strong>14</strong>.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722910?t=1759136442","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722910?t=1759136442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722910/acd317dfb63f65dda46847035d7e7694ffca2a9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759136442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722910/acd317dfb63f65dda46847035d7e7694ffca2a9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759136442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Legends of Azamar may contain content not appropriate for all ages. This game includes: frequent violence or gore against fantasy characters, general mature content, and elements of horror"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo for <strong>Legends of Azamar</strong> is a fast-paced action RPG focused on loot, dungeon crawling, and visceral combat. Answer the call of <strong>Tag Lodahn</strong>, a dwarven mining town now overwhelmed by relentless incursions. Driven by glory, treasure, or duty, descend into the depths, battle deadly foes, and uncover the secrets that lie below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes (Demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms as the <strong>Warrior</strong>, mastering unique weapons, abilities, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(More classes will be available in the full release.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawling Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends of Azamar</strong> is an ARPG condensed to its core.\u00a0Descend, fight, loot, return to camp, and repeat. Face increasingly deadly challenges as you push deeper, growing stronger with each expedition, culminating in brutal boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face Tag Lodahn's ever-shifting depths? Each expedition will never be the same with procedurally generated dungeons, dynamic paths, quests, and unique items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  character with legendary equipment, powerful passives, and devastating abilities. Shape your path with six unique passive skill trees, each offering new avenues of character customisation. Will you become an unbreakable juggernaut by following the path of the <strong>Tower</strong>? Or embrace the <strong>Serpent</strong>\u2019s cunning, and strike with lethal poisons? Or will you walk your own path?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Content</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>Warrior</strong> class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>entirety of Act 1</strong>, delving into the mines beneath Tag Lodahn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play until the level cap of\u00a0<strong>14</strong>.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gronkins"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3556700","name":"Legends of Azamar"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722910/5934bcc011e9fd366d59a93a2c6c886ce18b540e/header.jpg?t=1759136442","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.a